---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Get Your Copy — Bible of the Revolution"
  description="Donate $100 or give $17.76 a month to receive your own copy of the Bible of the Revolution — the Aitken Bible of 1782, with a preface by Kirk Cameron."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-brand-navy text-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20 md:py-28">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20 items-center">
        <div>
          <p class="text-brand-gold text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-6">Bible Revival · Limited Edition</p>
          <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-serif font-bold leading-tight">
            Own a Piece<br />
            of America's<br />
            <em class="not-italic text-brand-gold">Foundation.</em>
          </h1>
          <div class="mt-8 w-16 h-0.5 bg-brand-gold"></div>
          <p class="mt-6 text-base md:text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed max-w-lg">
            The first Bible printed in America. Endorsed by the Continental Congress. Carried by soldiers fighting for independence. Now available to you.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
            <a href="#donate" class="btn-primary text-base py-3 px-7 text-center">Get My Copy</a>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-gray-500">Books begin shipping late September 2026.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-12 lg:mt-0">
          <img
            src="/images/bible-of-the-revolution.webp"
            alt="Bible of the Revolution — the Aitken Bible of 1782"
            class="w-full"
            loading="eager"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The offer -->
  <section class="bg-brand-rust text-white py-14">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-red-200 mb-4">How to Receive Your Copy</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif font-bold">Two ways to give. One book that changes everything.</h2>
      <div class="mt-10 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-left">
        <div class="bg-white/10 rounded-xl p-6 border border-white/20">
          <div class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-gold">$100+</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-red-200">One-Time Gift</div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-red-100 leading-relaxed">
            A single gift of $100 or more secures your copy of the Bible of the Revolution and directly funds the Bible Revival program.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white/10 rounded-xl p-6 border border-white/20">
          <div class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-gold">$17.76<span class="text-lg font-sans">/mo</span></div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-red-200">Monthly Recurring</div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-red-100 leading-relaxed">
            Give $17.76 a month — honoring the year of America's independence — and receive your copy as a founding supporter of Bible Revival.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6 text-xs text-red-200">Books begin shipping late September 2026 · Brave for Good is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit — your gift is tax-deductible.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The history -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-rust mb-6">The Story</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-navy leading-tight">
        The book England tried to keep from America.
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-[1.0625rem]">
        <p>
          In 1782, with the Revolutionary War still raging and Scripture nearly impossible to obtain, a Philadelphia printer named Robert Aitken set out to do what no one in America had done before: print a complete English Bible on American soil, for an American people.
        </p>
        <p>
          It earned its nickname as the "Bible of the Revolution" when England had cut off the colonies' only supply of Bibles, and Aitken's edition rose to meet the need as the war drew to its close. The Congress fighting for independence did something it has never done before or since, unanimously endorsing his work and recommending the Bible of the Revolution "to the inhabitants of the United States."
        </p>
        <p>
          Small enough to fit in a Continental soldier's coat pocket and printed five years before the Constitution itself, it stands at the very foundation of the nation. Robert Aitken gave everything to make it, and died in debt and obscurity for his sacrifice.
        </p>
        <p class="font-semibold text-brand-navy">
          Of the ten thousand copies printed, fewer than fifty survive today.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Kirk Cameron section -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-brand-cream border-t border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-[200px_1fr] gap-10 items-start">
        <div>
          <img
            src="/images/kirk-headshot.webp"
            alt="Kirk Cameron"
            class="w-full rounded-sm"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-rust mb-4">Preface by</p>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-navy">Kirk Cameron</h2>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              Kirk Cameron — actor, filmmaker, and one of America's most recognized voices for faith and family — wrote the preface to the Bible of the Revolution. His introduction places the Aitken Bible in its historical and spiritual context, speaking directly to why this book matters for the next generation of Americans.
            </p>
            <p>
              Kirk has dedicated much of his life to equipping parents and children with the stories, history, and convictions that shaped American civilization. The Bible of the Revolution is a natural extension of that mission.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Donation form -->
  <section id="donate" class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-navy">Secure Your Copy Today</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600">Give $100+ or $17.76/month. Books ship late September 2026.</p>
      </div>
      <iframe
        src="https://secure.anedot.com/brave-for-good/fc2adfa2-2bc3-4da5-9577-ff980de9bf45?embed=true"
        width="100%"
        style="border: none; min-height: 700px;"
        title="Donate to receive your Bible of the Revolution"
      ></iframe>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
